BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/Event-Launch-Kit-Anime-Market-Houston-III.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Event-Launch-Kit-Anime-Market-Houston-III.png
UID:nvdXC2XbqGVO-Gb02NFjm
SUMMARY:Anime Market Houston III
DTSTAMP:20260823T033705Z
DTSTART:20260912T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:💮✨ Anime Market Houston III – Celebrating The Worlds We Love ✨💮
	\nEvery anime fan has that one series. The one that got you hooked. The ch
	aracter you’ll always root for. The opening song you never skip. The momen
	t that made you say\, “Okay\, I need to see what happens next.” \nThat’s w
	hat Anime Market Houston III is all about. \n🗓️ Date & Time: September 12–1
	3\, 2026 | 10AM – 5PM\n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston
	\, TX 77036\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🌟 Event Highlights\n🛍️ Massi
	ve Anime Marketplace\nExplore a floor filled with anime-focused vendors fe
	aturing figures\, statues\, Nendoroids\, Gunpla\, manga\, apparel\, blind 
	boxes\, plushies\, accessories\, and fan-made creations inspired by the sh
	ows and characters fans love. Find something that reminds you of a favorit
	e moment\, adds to your collection\, or introduces you to something new. 💮
	✨ \n  \n💖 A Gathering for Anime Lovers\nTalk about your favorite character
	s\, recommend a series someone has to watch\, compare collections\, show o
	ff cosplay\, and connect with fans who understand the excitement of findin
	g a new favorite anime. \n  \n🧸 Collectibles Beyond Anime\nIn addition to 
	anime vendors\, explore our 50+ CCS Family Vendors featuring collectibles 
	like retro video games\, trading cards\, comics\, toys\, and pop culture f
	inds. There’s always something unexpected waiting to be discovered. \n  \n
	🌸 Interested in Being a Vendor?\nWe’re looking for anime-focused\, non-TCG
	 vendors to join Anime Market Houston III and help grow Houston’s anime co
	mmunity.\n🔗 Vendor Application: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHous
	ton  \n  \n👥 We’re Looking for Collaborators\n🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://f
	orms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n🎤 Workshops & Panels → https://forms.gle/KAqqM
	sUtw4gB23oo9\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6\nH
	ave a love for anime and want to be part of the adventure? Bring your pass
	ion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 📩 \n  \n🏨 Special Hotel Deals\nEn
	joy a special room rate of $79/night at TownePlace Suites\, just about 15 
	minutes from the venue!\nBook your stay 👉 https://www.marriott.com/event-r
	eservations/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink \n💮
	 Your next favorite series\, your next favorite creator\, and your next fa
	vorite find could be waiting at Anime Market Houston III. 🎌✨\n\nhttps://cc
	s-houston.com/events/anime-market-houston-iii/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/anime-market-houston-iii/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
